node_modules
# Nested workspace installs too (apps/web/node_modules): a bare `node_modules`
# only matches the context root, so a host-side apps/web/node_modules (macOS
# natives) would otherwise leak into `COPY . .` and diverge local smoke builds
# from the deploy host. In-image deps come exclusively from the deps stage.
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.git
.context
.omx
.omc
.agent
.claude
.claude/
._*
# AppleDouble metadata companions appear NEXT TO files on NFS/SMB-shared
# checkouts (e.g. apps/web/._data) and BuildKit's tar sender chokes on their
# xattrs; the bare `._*` above only matches the context root. Same fix as the
# long-standing `**/._*` entry in apps/web/.dockerignore.
**/._*
*.tsbuildinfo
.github
.vscode
**/.env*
**/*.db
apps/web/public/uploads
apps/web/public/uploads/**
apps/web/public/resources
apps/web/public/resources/**
apps/web/data
build
dist
test/
*.log
*.md
!apps/web/README.md
